{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/vmxcn658","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":60,"top":113,"width":1155,"height":43},"text":"在SEATrack基础上增加训练期的跨模态特征关系约束","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":21,"typeface":"Hiragino Sans GB","color":"#546876","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/alobe143","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":60,"top":180,"width":1140,"height":44},"text":"要解决的问题","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Hiragino Sans GB","color":"#007F82","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/5czutgnq","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":60,"top":233,"width":1140,"height":90},"text":"在保留原有跨模态交互的基础上，额外约束空间关系，\n能否让两模态的表征更一致，并改善目标定位？","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Hiragino Sans GB","color":"#142C3E","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/kb6tkbm5","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":60,"top":344,"width":1140,"height":44},"text":"我的工作内容","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Hiragino Sans GB","color":"#007F82","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/jqxcrq5k","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":60,"top":397,"width":1140,"height":90},"text":"理解SS与语义anchor的含义，明确约束如何作用于训练；\n实现损失与训练接入，并设计对照实验。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Hiragino Sans GB","color":"#142C3E","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ipobil4z","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":60,"top":508,"width":1140,"height":44},"text":"当前阶段","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Hiragino Sans GB","color":"#007F82","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/tgzux0nm","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":60,"top":561,"width":1140,"height":90},"text":"完整SS方案已实现并开始正式训练，\n目前用中间轮次的跟踪与特征结果检查改进是否产生预期变化。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Hiragino Sans GB","color":"#142C3E","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/1mqnin","slideIndex":0,"text":"这次工作主要围绕师兄提出的改进展开，而不是重新介绍SEATrack原论文。师兄的想法是在已有匹配响应交互之外，进一步约束特征内部的空间关系。我最近先理解了SS、语义anchor以及损失如何影响特征学习，再把完整两两SS方案落实到代码，最后通过真实训练和中间轮次的可视化检查实际变化。现阶段目标是验证这项附加约束是否有作用，不能预先认定一定提高定位精度。\n依据：师兄的想法与建议.rtfd/TXT.rtf、后续完整pairwise SS建议、本科毕业设计任务书。"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/c1ctf3","slideIndex":1,"layout":{"id":"ly/14ra9krq","name":"Blank"},"title":"我对改进思路的理解：约束patch之间的关系","textShapes":8,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/uxsni9ob","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":58,"top":42,"width":1164,"height":65},"text":"我对改进思路的理解：约束patch之间的关系","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":40,"typeface":"Hiragino Sans GB","color":"#142C3E","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/hk36to7m","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":60,"top":113,"width":1155,"height":43},"text":"比较关系结构，而不要求RGB与热红外特征逐维相同","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":21,"typeface":"Hiragino Sans GB","color":"#546876","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/gzu5kj6h","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":60,"top":180,"width":1140,"height":44},"text":"空间自相似性（SS）","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Hiragino Sans GB","color":"#007F82","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/3mloveps","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":60,"top":233,"width":1140,"height":90},"text":"先在RGB、热红外各自内部计算patch相似关系，\n再约束两种模态的关系描述保持一致。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Hiragino Sans GB","color":"#142C3E","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/2lcnm9o7","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":60,"top":344,"width":1140,"height":44},"text":"语义anchor的作用","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Hiragino Sans GB","color":"#007F82","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/po36xo7y","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":60,"top":397,"width":1140,"height":90},"text":"平均池化或可学习query可构建代表向量，\n用patch与anchor的相似度形成更紧凑的关系描述。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Hiragino Sans GB","color":"#142C3E","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/onu5oj6d","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":60,"top":508,"width":1140,"height":44},"text":"辅助损失如何起作用","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Hiragino Sans GB","color":"#007F82","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/bq5ozyp4","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":60,"top":561,"width":1140,"height":90},"text":"关系差异通过反向传播更新已有轻量微调参数，\n影响后续提取的特征；推理时不需要辅助损失分支。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Hiragino Sans GB","color":"#142C3E","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/c1ctf3","slideIndex":1,"text":"SS描述的是同一模态内部各个patch之间的相似关系。不同模态的外观可以不同，但目标及周围区域的空间关系可能有可比较的部分。我们将两个模态各自得到的关系描述进行比较。语义anchor是另一种更紧凑的关系表示：例如平均池化构建一个代表向量，再计算各patch与它的相似度。可学习query也是师兄提出的备选构建方式，但当前没有实现为主实验。最后，关系差异通过辅助损失反向传播，更新已有可训练参数，并影响之后的特征提取，不是在同一次前向中直接改写特征。\n依据：师兄建议；SEATrack-main/README_SS.md与semantic_alignment.py。关系建模文献见备份页。"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/n0fspb","slideIndex":2,"layout":{"id":"ly/14ra9krq","name":"Blank"},"title":"当前方案：先验证完整SS，再考虑anchor简化","textShapes":4,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/byxorudw","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":58,"top":42,"width":1164,"height":65},"text":"当前方案：先验证完整SS，再考虑anchor简化","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":40,"typeface":"Hiragino Sans GB","color":"#142C3E","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
